{"history":[{"revision":1,"at":"2026-09-23T21:46:20+00:00","actor":"austin","reason":"Codex Astra source review requested by Austin: review all 61 events; recode two WDC bids Conditions Unclear because an intended signing timetable does not establish limited diligence; narrow Company H response window; preserve process/round facts while flagging Alex-only boundary conventions. All other supported rows reviewed; no missing material event verified.","summary":"73 changes","changes":[{"sheet":"Deal ledger","uid":"0e44959b47f4bcf77be273b6","record_label":"Event #44 · 05/28/2013 · WDC · Bid","field":"Conditions","before":"Light","after":"Unclear","type":"update"},{"sheet":"Deal ledger","uid":"0e44959b47f4bcf77be273b6","record_label":"Event #44 · 05/28/2013 · WDC · Bid","field":"Note","before":"Light: it contemplated signing by 06/03, leaving only expedited diligence; no financing condition reported. Formal: merger agreement markup and draft ancillary agreements, answering the final-round letter. WDC called $9.15 its highest price and noted internal concerns about the price (p. 30).","after":"Unclear: the bid contemplated signing by 06/03 but did not state that remaining diligence was only limited or confirmatory. Formal: priced merger-agreement markup and ancillary drafts answered the final-round letter. WDC subsequently described internal price concerns.","type":"update"},{"sheet":"Deal ledger","uid":"c21bdeef33a5834f2255ecd0","record_label":"Event #41 · weeks of 05/13 and 05/20/2013, after 05/15 · Company H · Other material event","field":"Date to","before":"2013-05-26","after":"2013-05-23","type":"update"},{"sheet":"Deal ledger","uid":"1914c22f7434ec4225f35b82","record_label":"Event #55 · 06/14/2013 · WDC · Bid","field":"Conditions","before":"Light","after":"Unclear","type":"update"},{"sheet":"Deal ledger","uid":"1914c22f7434ec4225f35b82","record_label":"Event #55 · 06/14/2013 · WDC · Bid","field":"Note","before":"Light: WDC could announce by 06/24, leaving only expedited diligence (confirmatory calls 06/16–06/22); no financing condition reported. Formal: answers the best-offer request on its 05/28 terms, including its markup. WDC called $6.85 its best and final price.","after":"Unclear: the bid targeted a 06/24 announcement without specifying the scope of remaining diligence. Formal: best-and-final $6.85 on the 05/28 transaction terms, including its markup. Additional diligence, including confirmatory calls, occurred 06/16-06/22 (p. 33).","type":"update"},{"sheet":"Deal ledger","uid":"00a327462413563d53bb8a4b","record_label":"Event #7 · 02/13/2013 · sTec · Target sale decision","field":"Flag","before":"","after":"Q2","type":"update"},{"sheet":"Questions","uid":"53a8a4850422c6da2bccb630","record_label":"Question Q6","field":"Recommended answer","before":"Light for both.","after":"Unclear for both bids. A short intended signing/announcement timetable alone does not establish that remaining diligence was limited or confirmatory.","type":"update"},{"sheet":"Questions","uid":"53a8a4850422c6da2bccb630","record_label":"Question Q6","field":"Why, with page","before":"Each bid gave a short signing or announcement horizon: 'signing definitive documentation ... by no later than June 3' (p. 30) and 'in a position to announce a transaction on June 24' (p. 32). That means expedited diligence only; the later diligence was described as 'confirmatory' (p. 33). No financing condition is reported, and the merger agreement has none (p. 36).","after":"May 28 contemplated signing by June 3 (p. 30); May 30 still sought to complete diligence (p. 31). June 14 targeted June 24 (p. 32). Later diligence included confirmatory calls (p. 33), without limiting all diligence at either bid date. E12 requires contemporaneous support.","type":"update"},{"sheet":"Questions","uid":"53a8a4850422c6da2bccb630","record_label":"Question Q6","field":"What changes if answered differently","before":"Unclear on either row would weaken the evidence that WDC's winning offers were near-unconditional. Formality is unaffected.","after":"Light would classify these offers as carrying only limited remaining conditions without affirmative evidence. Formality and price paths remain unchanged.","type":"update"},{"sheet":"Questions","uid":"aac7e3fd8bc9d43d39818d8e","record_label":"Question Q2","field":"Recommended answer","before":"Yes. One process. R1 = outreach and non-binding indications; R2 = final-round letters to WDC and D (announced final); R3 = the stage after WDC withdrew, ending in signing. Plausible alternatives: R1 opening at the 03/26 board decision (moves nothing but the marker); no R3 (rows #50–#60 move to R2).","after":"Provisionally retain one process with R1 outreach, R2 final-round letters and inferred R3 after WDC withdrew. Ask Alex whether the approximately three-month hiatus warrants a separate process and whether May 31 starts a new round. The source facts remain unchanged.","type":"update"},{"sheet":"Questions","uid":"aac7e3fd8bc9d43d39818d8e","record_label":"Question Q2","field":"Why, with page","before":"Gaps of about two months or more with no acquirer contact: 11/14/2012 (Company A contact; the cancellation was sent later, date not given) to 02/13/2013 (Company B), just under three months. E5 tests: (a) met, since nothing was pending with A; (b) not established, as the gap is under three months and no end was reported (the board 'made a determination to continue', p. 24); (c) met by the 02/13 committee. Hence one process. R3 is inferred because the 05/30 selection collapsed when WDC withdrew and the target re-invited D (p. 31).","after":"The last precisely dated acquirer contact is 11/14/2012; Company A was told of cancellation later, on an unreported date. The next dated acquirer contact is 02/13/2013. E5(a) appears met; E5(b) is uncertain because the gap's start is undated, not because about three months means a strict calendar threshold; E5(c) is met by the 02/13 committee. Retain one process provisionally. The 05/31 round boundary is inferred from the collapse of the 05/30 WDC selection, while Company D was allowed to continue (p. 31).","type":"update"},{"sheet":"Questions","uid":"aac7e3fd8bc9d43d39818d8e","record_label":"Question Q2","field":"Rows affected","before":"#13, #39, #50","after":"#7, #13, #39, #50","type":"update"},{"sheet":"row_review","uid":"f760833c28611fa6e501debe","record_label":"Event #21 · 04/17/2013 · WDC · NDA signed","field":null,"before":null,"after":{"status":"reviewed","note":"","actor":"austin","at":"2026-09-23T21:46:20+00:00"},"type":"decision"},{"sheet":"row_review","uid":"e0db1de01e3cd9ad3ff4b8a1","record_label":"Event #20 · 04/17/2013 · Company G · NDA signed","field":null,"before":null,"after":{"status":"reviewed","note":"","actor":"austin","at":"2026-09-23T21:46:20+00:00"},"type":"decision"},{"sheet":"row_review","uid":"855cfae254dfc89c49928473","record_label":"Event #57 · 06/17/2013 · Paul Hastings LLP · Adviser","field":null,"before":null,"after":{"status":"reviewed","note":"","actor":"austin","at":"2026-09-23T21:46:20+00:00"},"type":"decision"},{"sheet":"row_review","uid":"9b198c1a08187c065196a751","record_label":"Event #11 · 03/26/2013 · BofA Merrill Lynch · Adviser","field":null,"before":null,"after":{"status":"reviewed","note":"","actor":"austin","at":"2026-09-23T21:46:20+00:00"},"type":"decision"},{"sheet":"row_review","uid":"014b564f999c1bd67656cd29","record_label":"Event #36 · 05/14/2013 · Company D · Other material event","field":null,"before":null,"after":{"status":"reviewed","note":"","actor":"austin","at":"2026-09-23T21:46:20+00:00"},"type":"decision"},{"sheet":"row_review","uid":"0204d11cb7a286eb5e8715f3","record_label":"Event #56 · 06/15/2013 · sTec · Other material event","field":null,"before":null,"after":{"status":"reviewed","note":"","actor":"austin","at":"2026-09-23T21:46:20+00:00"},"type":"decision"},{"sheet":"row_review","uid":"eb52ccb9bb3d728b428fa658","record_label":"Event #46 · 05/29/2013 · sTec · Deadline revised","fie